metric signature $(-,+,+,+)$, Levi-Civita connection $\nabla_\mu$, and Ricci
scalar $\RicciScalar$. We postulate that spacetime geometry couples to both
the quantum stress-energy expectation value and an informational entropy field.

\begin{definition}[Informational Entropy Functional]
Given microstate projectors $\{\mathcal{E}_i\}$ with probabilities
$p_i = \mathrm{Tr}(\hat{\rho}\,\mathcal{E}_i)$, the Shannon entropy is:
\begin{equation}
    \Sshannon = -\sum_i p_i \log_2 p_i.
\end{equation}
The informational curvature scalar is:
\begin{equation}
    \Centropy = \kappa_{\text{info}} \Sshannon \RicciScalar,
\end{equation}
with $\kappa_{\text{info}} = -\alpha_0 < 0$.
\end{definition}

\begin{postulate}[Extended Action Functional]
